"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-109-liguang:p010","c-shiji-109-liguang:p011","c-shiji-109-liguang:p013"],"note":"元朔六年、元朔五年兩名匿名大將軍與後段具名青，官號及武帝出征語境相近，但各次出征尚未逐項對讀，保留來源候選，不自動同指或推連續任期。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"大將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"q8s_3lk_4sq","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji109-057","person_id":"q8s_3lk_4sq","title":"大將軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p011","quote":"初，廣之從弟李蔡與廣俱事孝文帝。景帝時，蔡積功勞至二千石。孝武帝時，至代相。以元朔五年爲輕車將車，從大將軍擊右賢王，有功中率，封爲樂安侯。元狩二年中，代公孫弘爲丞相。蔡爲人在下中，名聲出廣下甚遠，然廣不得爵邑，官不過九卿，而蔡爲列侯，位至三公。諸廣之軍吏及士卒或取封侯。廣嘗與望氣王朔燕語，曰：「自漢擊匈奴而廣未嘗不在其中，而諸部校尉以下，才能不及中人，然以擊胡軍功取侯者數十人，而廣不爲後人，然無尺寸之功以得封邑者，何也？豈吾相不當侯邪？且固命也？」朔曰：「將軍自念，豈嘗有所恨乎？」廣曰：「吾嘗爲隴西守，羌嘗反，吾誘而降，降者八百餘人，吾詐而同日殺之。至今大恨獨此耳。」朔曰：「禍莫大於殺已降，此乃將軍所以不得侯者也。」"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji109-057:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p011","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"大將軍","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0050","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示任官或敘事用稱；二千石為秩稱，三公為概括位階，望氣為技能稱，不推確切職級或連續任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p010","text":"居頃之，石建卒，於是上召廣代建爲郎中令。元朔六年，廣復爲後將軍，從大將軍軍出定襄，擊匈奴。諸將多中首虜率以功爲侯者，而廣軍無功。後二歳，廣以郎中令將四千騎出右北平，博望侯張騫將萬騎與廣俱，異道。行可數百里，匈奴左賢王將四萬騎圍廣，廣軍士皆恐，廣乃使其子敢往馳之。敢獨與數十騎馳，直貫胡騎，出其左右而還，告廣曰：「胡虜易與耳。」軍士乃安。廣爲圜陳外向，胡急擊之，矢下如雨。漢兵死者過半，漢矢且盡。廣乃令士持滿毋發，而廣身自以大黃射其裨將，殺數人，胡虜益解。會日暮，吏士皆無人色，而廣意氣自如，益治軍。軍中自是服其勇也。明日，復力戰，而博望侯軍亦至，匈奴軍乃解去。漢軍罷，弗能追。是時廣軍幾沒，罷歸。漢法，博望侯留遲後期，當死，贖爲庶人。廣軍功自如，無賞。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"石建","kind":"person","person_id":"gtg_ugc_14i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"5k5_3ag_agc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"gtg_ugc_14i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"大將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"10h_plg_i97","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"博望侯","kind":"person","person_id":"gqj_xdu_8rf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"張騫","kind":"person","person_id":"gqj_xdu_8rf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0091","start":91,"end":92,"surface":"廣","kind":"p