"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0301","start":301,"end":304,"surface":"博望侯","kind":"person","person_id":"gqj_xdu_8rf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0317","start":317,"end":318,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","book_id":"b-shiji-109","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p011","text":"初，廣之從弟李蔡與廣俱事孝文帝。景帝時，蔡積功勞至二千石。孝武帝時，至代相。以元朔五年爲輕車將車，從大將軍擊右賢王，有功中率，封爲樂安侯。元狩二年中，代公孫弘爲丞相。蔡爲人在下中，名聲出廣下甚遠，然廣不得爵邑，官不過九卿，而蔡爲列侯，位至三公。諸廣之軍吏及士卒或取封侯。廣嘗與望氣王朔燕語，曰：「自漢擊匈奴而廣未嘗不在其中，而諸部校尉以下，才能不及中人，然以擊胡軍功取侯者數十人，而廣不爲後人，然無尺寸之功以得封邑者，何也？豈吾相不當侯邪？且固命也？」朔曰：「將軍自念，豈嘗有所恨乎？」廣曰：「吾嘗爲隴西守，羌嘗反，吾誘而降，降者八百餘人，吾詐而同日殺之。至今大恨獨此耳。」朔曰：「禍莫大於殺已降，此乃將軍所以不得侯者也。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"李蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ocv_s0f_djg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"psw_g1p_89x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"xd0_1s0_wag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ocv_s0f_djg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"孝武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"5k5_3ag_agc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"