_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0287","start":287,"end":288,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"224_en7_aho","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","book_id":"b-shiji-109","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p013","text":"廣既從大將軍青擊匈奴，既出塞，青捕虜知單于所居，乃自以精兵走之，而令廣并於右將軍軍，出東道。東道少回遠，而大軍行水草少，其勢不屯行。廣自請曰：「臣部爲前將軍，今大將軍乃徙令臣出東道，且臣結髪而與匈奴戰，今乃一得當單于，臣願居前，先死單于。」大將軍青亦陰受上誡，以爲李廣老，數奇，毋令當單于，恐不得所欲。而是時公孫敖新失侯，爲中將軍從大將軍，大將軍亦欲使敖與俱當單于，故徙前將軍廣。廣時知之，固自辭於大將軍。大將軍不聽，令長史封書與廣之莫府，曰：「急詣部，如書。」廣不謝大將軍而起行，意甚慍怒而就部，引兵與右將軍食其合軍出東道。軍亡導，或失道，後大將軍。大將軍與單于接戰，單于遁走，弗能得而還。南絶幕，遇前將軍、右將軍。廣已見大將軍，還入軍。大將軍使長史持糒醪遺廣，因問廣、食其失道狀，青欲上書報天子軍曲折。廣未對，大將軍使長史急責廣之幕府對簿。廣曰：「諸校尉無罪，乃我自失道。吾今自上簿。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"大將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"uh7_kln_nf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"青","kind":"person","person_id":"uh7_kln_nf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"青","kind":"person","person_id":"uh7_kln_nf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"v2f_t9q_ipy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"右將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"ocq_qf7_m3w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_